 "<div style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#3f9d68\">MASA</div><div style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace;font-size:44px;font-weight:700;color:#5dff9b;line-height:1.15\">1,4 soles</div><div>apretados en ese espacio</div>": "<div style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#3f9d68\">MASSA</div><div style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace;font-size:44px;font-weight:700;color:#5dff9b;line-height:1.15\">1,4 sóis</div><div>apertados nesse espaço</div>",
